{"4083200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Remi", "steam_appid": 4083200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by a mind-controlling virus, the infected—known as the Plagued—roam as violent, uncontrollable monsters. The Vanguard were a band of heroes with one sworn purpose: A promise to eradicate this world of the Plagued. As the last surviving member of the Vanguard, Remi journeys to fulfill that promise, even if it means encountering familiar faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, combat-driven journey of duty, loss, and resolve awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a bleak post-apocalyptic world as Remi, cutting through hordes of Plagued enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight powerful enemies and bosses that challenge your ability as a player </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by leveling up Remi’s combat abilities through battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden relics that assist you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lore of the world and its fallen heroes through in-game entries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo developer passion project.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a post-apocalyptic world ravaged by a mind-controlling virus, the infected—known as the Plagued—roam as violent, uncontrollable monsters. The Vanguard were a band of heroes with one sworn purpose: A promise to eradicate this world of the Plagued. As the last surviving member of the Vanguard, Remi journeys to fulfill that promise, even if it means encountering familiar faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dark, combat-driven journey of duty, loss, and resolve awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a bleak post-apocalyptic world as Remi, cutting through hordes of Plagued enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight powerful enemies and bosses that challenge your ability as a player </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger by leveling up Remi’s combat abilities through battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden relics that assist you in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the lore of the world and its fallen heroes through in-game entries</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A solo developer passion project.</p>", "short_description": "An action RPG about Remi, the last remaining member of the Vanguard. Engage in challenging combat with the Plagued, mind-controlled enemies to fulfill Remi's oath to save the world from these monsters. A passion project made by a single developer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083200/c87fdc1933f7198b2cfa09e38fb9b500c032811b/header.jpg?t=1782838342", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083200/a49c7507a556125ee001f359208ec3cc724a4027/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782838342", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083200/a49c7507a556125ee001f359208ec3cc724a4027/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782838342", "website": "https://antu3199.itch.io/remi", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB) or AMD Radeon RX 580 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>Di